OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSqually rain
OL,6,Fclearing the southeast this evening.
OL,7,FClear spells overnight though
OL,8,Fscattered showers developing, these
OL,9,Fheaviest and most frequent in the
OL,10,Fnorthwest where hail and thunder is
OL,11,Fpossible. Winds easing in the south
OL,12,Fbut gales developing in the northwest.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FA changeable day consisting
OL,15,Fof sunny spells and showers, these
OL,16,Fisolated and brief in the south but
OL,17,Fheavier and more frequent further
OL,18,Fnorth. Windy with coastal gales in the
OL,19,Fnorth.
